WEBVTT


00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.047
Shit!


00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.605
Oh, fuck!


00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.570
Oh, come on! Come on!


00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.648
Fuck's sake!


00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:52.929
Help! Help, someone!
Let me in, please!


00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:03.007
Someone, please, help me!
Let me in! Please!


00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.246
Shit. No, please, let me go.
Please. Please! Please!


00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:22.966
Fucking... Oh! Fuck off!


00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.163
Please, please... Please don't hurt me.


00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:31.643
'This is the police.
Please wait to be connected.'


00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:44.202
Now what? Get up! Get up!


00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:46.402
Right, get up! Get up!


00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.443
Fucker!


00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:54.684
Fucking get off him!


00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:58.043
You don't know... No! No!


00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.002
Fuck you!


00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.600
No!


00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.688
You bitch!


00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.969
Wait, wait...


00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.602
Please help me! Please!
Shut the fuck up!


00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.529
Please!
Shut up!


00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:21.486
Help! Please! Help me!


00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.729
Please! Help me!


00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:31.364
Help! Help me! Please!


00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:39.482
Look, I told you, I was mugged.
I never saw anybody attack that boy.


00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.171
The paramedics found you
outside your door.


00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:45.727
- It must have been the same people.
- I never saw them.


00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:49.401
- Was your partner in?
- He doesn't live here anymore.


00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.729
Look, I've spoken to everyone


00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:56.162
and we've got nothing to help us
identify the attackers.


00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:59.170
- Nothing at all.
- It's not my fault.


00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:04.521
Please. I know you're scared,
but we can protect you.


00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.881
We want to put away whoever did this.


00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:11.403
The boy's father has given us names of
several people his son hung around with.


00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:15.081
We can do a line up,
but without a witness, we have nothing!


00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:19.125
- Why won't any of you talk to us?
- I told you, I never saw anything!


00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.524
Fine.


00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:28.525
If you think of anything else,
please call me.


00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:41.241
Take it from me,
a hint of paperwork, boredom'll get ya.


00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.761
Nah, Daniel's not gonna let that happen.


00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.201
Officer on deck.


00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:48.368
- See ya later, Guv.
- See ya later.


00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.563
- Anything?
- Complete waste of time.


00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.729
Half of them didn't even
want to be seen talking to me.


00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:57.411
- Forensics?
- Nothing useful.


00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:01.730
It's a public area.
Everyone and their grandma's left traces.


00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.569
Shit!


00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:07.082
15 years old, beaten to death
and nobody saw a fucking thing!


00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:12.083
No, they never do.


00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:15.924
Come on.
They don't want us here.


00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:39.811
I'll show you
the top floor and the roof.


00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:43.042
The rest is all boarded up.


00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.004
I mean, if it was me,
I wouldn't wait for rehousing.


00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:50.250
I'd kip on a mate's sofa till they found me
somewhere. But no, not this lot.


00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.330
They're sticking it out.
God help them.


00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.642
Can't you... convince them?


00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.964
First thing I thought of.
Council said it's illegal, technically a bribe.


00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:06.324
I said, "Call it a goodwill gift."
They wouldn't have any of it.


00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:09.649
No, I mean... persuade them.
Make them want to leave.


00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:13.890
Yeah, well, I might have to
if this drags on any longer.


00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.928
- It's down here.
- OK.


00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:36.770
Bloody kids keep trying to pick the lock.


00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:40.441
If one of them gets in and falls off
the roof, whose fault is it?


00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.962
Eh? Yeah.
Muggins here. Come on.


00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.680
I said leave me alone!


00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:51.009
- Let's just talk about it.
- It won't change anything.


00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.884
Please?


00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.970
I'll go first thing in the morning,
stay at my mum's.


00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:01.401
We can son this out.


00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.921
I'm so sorry.


00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.883
- Vic, are you on, mate?
- 'Yeah.'


00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.243
I'm on the bridge. Can you give me
a bit of cover in a minute


00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.328
cos I think Little Nunn's been...


00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.967
He's in all kinds of trouble over here.
Can you cover me?


00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:19.210
I need to... There's loads of them.
Honestly, it's fucking carnage.


00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.641
Not again!


00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:25.321
- Are you still on that bloody computer?
- Mum, you have to knock!


00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.444
- What's all the shouting?
- The internet's freezing.


00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:31.530
It's ruining my scores.
Are they working on the roof?


00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.883
I don't know. It might be an excuse
to get some fresh air.


00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.721
- Come on, it'll do you good.
- OK! After this game.


00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:44.927
Well, I tried!


00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:49.045
Tell him the building's on fire.
Come on, you scrawny bastard.


00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.891
I wish.
We might get rehoused quicker.


00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:54.044
Are you deaf?
What the fuck did I say to you?


00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:57.004
Get inside your room now! Let's go!


00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:00.488
You never do what you're told!
All the time talking the piss!


00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.001
- Excuse the residents.
- I've seen worse.


00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:06.010
- Don't fucking think I don't know!
- Get away!


00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.531
What you playing at?


00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:10.007
Mr Rawlins.
Checking on your investment?


00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:14.091
Yeah, all the good it's done me.
Had any word from the council?


00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.248
Not yet, no.


00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.806
No, didn't bloody think so.


00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:22.083
You taking the fucking piss!
Don't smile at me!


00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.921
Are you smiling at me? Don't you smile
at me! Or I'm gonna hit you!


00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.202
What? It's my fucking kids, innit?


00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.407
You're not knocking it down now,
are you?


00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.249
Just a preliminary check.


00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.727
Good! You better fucking not be,


00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:40.084
cos we'll go when the council says
and not before! Do you hear me?


00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:43.090
- They can hear you in Australia, love.
- Good!


00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:47.802
Should be a piece of cake.
We just wait for everyone to leave.


00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.922
Do we have to?


00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.964
Come on!


00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:21.731
- Hi, Liz.
- 'Hi!'


00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:25.083
- 'Are you coming to thingy's leaving do?'
- I don't know.


00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:28.044
'Oh! Even/one's going.
It'll be a laugh!'


00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:32.882
Er... No. I've hardly known him
the whole time he's worked there.


00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:36.482
I don't even know his name.
Anyway, you know I hate work dos.


00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:40.810
<i>'L'll keep calling until you say yes!
You know I will!'</i>


00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.571
Hello there, blondie!


00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:16.604
You look fucking lovely, don't ya?


00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.643
- Time to pay me.
- Piss off.


00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:21.081
Eh? What did I just fucking say to you?


00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.441
Do you need me to come in there, do ya?


00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:28.370
That's it. It's fucking easy.


00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:31.051
Oh, it's going up next week, as well.


00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.730
- What?
- 30 instead of 20.


00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:36.845
- Why? No, I can't afford...
- I know. Inflation and shit.


00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:40.009
Still, there are other methods
in which you can pay me.


00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:43.329
- Oh, fuck you!
- I'd love to smell your morning breath.


00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:49.527
Shame, that.
Right up my fucking street and all.


00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:57.083
Hello, Nanna! Did you miss me?


00:13:57.200 --> 00:14:00.010
All right, Vi. I got this.


00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.644
- Let's have it, then.
- Good manners cost nothing.


00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.491
You're not paying me
for fucking good manners.


00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:14.683
No. I'm paying you
not to smash up our flat.


00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:17.451
Don't expect me
to be scared of you, though.


00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:20.728
Bye then, son!


00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.568
Brave old soldier, you, eh?


00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:33.124
Bet your Mrs isn't so brave, though.
Bless her.


00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:36.961
Be a right shame if something
should happen to her, wouldn't it?


00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:40.368
Give her the fright of her life,
might have a heart attack.


00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.609
- You lay one finger on her...
- Whatever, mate.


00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.521
That's the one. Good man!


00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:49.449
See you again, yeah?


00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.882
Fucking arsehole.


00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:03.091
What you saying, Kurtis, man?
Let us know if you need any help, innit.


00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:05.248
What's that, lad?


00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:08.170
Saying, like,
if you needed any help, innit.


00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:10.282
Help?


00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:32.205
You keep an eye on your sister
or I'll break your fucking neck, right?


00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:42.245
- What?
- I didn't say anything.


00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:45.011
I can't afford a fucking babysitter, can I?


00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:48.283
You could if you didn't go out drinking
every night.


00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:52.166
Don't you tell me how to raise my kids.
Don't you fucking dare!


00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:55.170
Cos I will kick your fucking teeth in!
Yeah?


00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:02.283
That's what I thought... pussy.


00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.606
Oh, I'm sorry,
this was all I could find.


00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.682
It suits ya!


00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.643
Er, do you want a coffee?


00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:53.923
Well, that's what started
all the trouble last night.


00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.486
No, this time I mean actual coffee.


00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:59.968
- Yeah, I'd love one.
- OK, erm...


00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:12.127
Bollocks! There's so many of them, dude,
I don't know what I'm doing here.


00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:15.403
No.


00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:18.285
You're joking! Come on!


00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.881
I preferred the dressing gown.


00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:42.367
It looked good. Ladylike.


00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:44.642
Yeah? I wasn't feeling it.


00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:52.968
- Here you go.
- Thanks.


00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.684
- So...
- So...


00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.804
- It was a great party last night.
- Mm.


00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:13.129
Yeah, it was good.
It was really good fun.


00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.721
Look, I don't do this all the time.


00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:22.845
- What, drink coffee?
- No, you know what I mean.


00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:27.602
Erm, I... Ijust came out of
a long-term relationship a while ago


00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.485
and... well,
I haven't really been out much.


00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.887
I'm not used to it.


00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:36.326
I had a great time last night.


00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:40.161
- And I'm having a great time now.
- Me, too.


00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:43.204
- So don't worry about it.
- Thanks.


00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:48.969
We don't have to get married right now.
We can always wait till next week


00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:51.924
or next month if you like.
I mean, there's no hurry!


00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:55.601
So not funny!
My mum warned me about blokes like you.


00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:58.849
I should hope she did!
I'll tell you what though...


00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:14.450
- Danny, for goodness sake.
- lnternet's gone again.


00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:18.850
Mum! Mum! Come on, please!


00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:25.650
Mark! Get down, man! Get down!
Fuck, get down!


00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:28.730
Fuck! Shit!


00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:32.522
Down!


00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.321
It's all in your head, darling.


00:21:55.320 --> 00:21:57.607
What the fuck's that?


00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:11.088
OK. All right. OK. Stay down.


00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:15.046
Stay down. Towards the door.


00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:43.524
He's shooting at you, too?


00:22:43.640 --> 00:22:46.166
- Is anybody hurt?
- We're not hit. My dad...


00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:48.647
Oh, Jesus Christ!


00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.162
- We need a mobile phone!
- I've got one. It's not working.


00:22:52.280 --> 00:22:55.409
- Same here, there's no signal.
- The internet's down.


00:22:55.520 --> 00:22:58.763
- Is it some son of terrorist thing.
- Why us? Why here?


00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:02.089
- The police will son it out.
- But no-one's called them.


00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:05.761
- I didn't hear any shots.
- He must be using a sound suppressor.


00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:08.611
- So nobody heard it.
- The other block's empty.


00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:11.724
It's a quarter of a mile
to any other buildings.


00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:13.569
So no-one's coming for us.


00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:16.126
Oh, my God! Oh, my God,
we've got to get out of here.


00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:20.450
- No, don't, Mum. He's at the front.
- We'll go out the back, then!


00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:23.962
It's not coming on. It's not working.
Why is it not working?


00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:27.004
Probably the same reason
everything else is down.


00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:30.681
- We'll get help somehow.
- How? How are we gonna do that?


00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:33.724
- I don't know.
- Help!


00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:37.608
Help!


00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:40.121
Sit down, mate.


00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:44.203
Did you hear that?
Someone was shooting into our flat!


00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:47.847
- It's the same for all of us.
- Mark's been hurt! Someone help!


00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:51.043
He's been hurt!
He's gonna die if nobody helps him!


00:23:51.160 --> 00:23:55.245
Why should we?
You and that Kurtis bastard never help us!


00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:59.763
Come on! This is slightly different!
He's gonna die if nobody helps. Please!


00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:03.851
I can do first aid. Get me some
clean sheets or clothes and alcohol.


00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:05.962
We've got vodka and some T-shins!


00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:09.163
And if anyone has any painkillers,
bring them to me.


00:24:09.280 --> 00:24:12.124
- It's OK.
- It's gonna be all right, bruv.


00:24:13.920 --> 00:24:15.410
Jenny!


00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:18.683
Are you OK?
Where's the kids?


00:24:18.800 --> 00:24:22.805
They wanted to watch cartoons.


00:24:27.680 --> 00:24:29.569
I stayed in bed.


00:24:32.920 --> 00:24:34.843
Then I heard screaming.


00:24:34.960 --> 00:24:37.406
OK, ready? Ready?


00:24:37.520 --> 00:24:40.410
Fuck!


00:24:41.640 --> 00:24:44.484
- Good lad.
- Did one of you do this?


00:24:44.600 --> 00:24:47.968
Why would I do that?
That's your department, vandalism.


00:24:48.080 --> 00:24:51.323
Why would someone do it?
They never did nothing to nobody!


00:24:51.440 --> 00:24:54.011
He's shooting at everyone.
We don't know why.


00:24:54.120 --> 00:24:56.930
- They was just kids!
- I know, I know!


00:24:57.040 --> 00:25:00.089
We'll call for help.
We're gonna get out of here, OK?


00:25:08.800 --> 00:25:11.406
- Please, somebody!
- Jesus! Violet!


00:25:14.120 --> 00:25:16.600
- Where you going?
- It's OK.


00:25:16.720 --> 00:25:20.008
Just keep still.
I'm gonna help you.


00:25:22.960 --> 00:25:25.611
What's the point? Look at her!


00:25:25.720 --> 00:25:30.009
She's fucked!
What's a bit of torn-up T-shin gonna do?


00:25:30.120 --> 00:25:32.122
Just shut up!


00:25:32.240 --> 00:25:36.086
Just lie there and don't move. Shhh...


00:25:36.200 --> 00:25:37.884
Don't try to talk.


00:25:39.160 --> 00:25:41.083
- Where's Jeff?
- Shh.


00:25:41.200 --> 00:25:43.567
It's OK.


00:25:43.680 --> 00:25:45.921
We'll get help
and we'll get you out of here.


00:25:46.040 --> 00:25:48.771
We're all gonna make it. OK?


00:25:48.880 --> 00:25:50.962
' OK?


00:25:54.960 --> 00:25:57.167
Fuck, fuck, fuck.


00:25:57.280 --> 00:26:00.727
- Help! Amy?
- He's alive.


00:26:00.840 --> 00:26:03.002
- Amy!
- He needs help!


00:26:03.120 --> 00:26:05.441
- We're not going in!
- Nobody asked you to.


00:26:05.560 --> 00:26:07.642
But somebody's gotta go in there!


00:26:08.720 --> 00:26:11.087
And that would be me, apparently.


00:26:11.200 --> 00:26:13.806
I'll go. I don't mind.


00:26:15.440 --> 00:26:19.843
I mean, you've all got someone, I haven't.
Makes sense, really.


00:26:39.600 --> 00:26:42.080
- Are you ready?
- Not really.


00:26:43.080 --> 00:26:44.730
Thank you.


00:26:45.920 --> 00:26:48.366
I had an opening in my schedule.


00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:00.770
Jeff.


00:27:03.200 --> 00:27:05.168
Jeff, come on.


00:27:08.200 --> 00:27:11.409
- Where is she?
- She's in the hall.


00:27:11.520 --> 00:27:13.204
Come on.


00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:25.844
That's it, Jeff.
That's it, keep...


00:27:25.960 --> 00:27:30.045
That's it. Stay down, down, down.
Stay down, stay down.


00:27:30.160 --> 00:27:31.889
Stay down.


00:27:38.960 --> 00:27:41.042
I'm so sorry.


00:28:05.960 --> 00:28:09.521
Is everyone accounted for?
Who's missing?


00:28:10.720 --> 00:28:12.927
Kurtis.


00:28:14.400 --> 00:28:16.323
I suppose I better go and check.


00:28:16.440 --> 00:28:18.442
- I'll wait here.
- OK.


00:28:44.080 --> 00:28:46.208
Kurtis!


00:28:47.400 --> 00:28:49.641
Kurtis, are you in there?


00:28:50.680 --> 00:28:52.330
Kurtis!


00:28:59.120 --> 00:29:00.884
It's OK, come on.


00:29:06.880 --> 00:29:08.769
Check in there.


00:29:28.960 --> 00:29:31.167
Yeah, he's... he's not in there.


00:29:37.120 --> 00:29:38.884
Ready?


00:29:49.240 --> 00:29:51.163
It's OK.


00:30:01.600 --> 00:30:03.489
Kurtis, no!


00:30:03.600 --> 00:30:07.047
- What the fuck are you playing at?
- Take it easy.


00:30:07.160 --> 00:30:10.448
You fucking take it easy!
Come closer, watch what I'll do!


00:30:10.560 --> 00:30:13.450
Please,
we just wanted to check you were OK.


00:30:14.480 --> 00:30:18.769
Right. Well, I'm fine. Thanks for asking.
How the fuck are you?


00:30:18.880 --> 00:30:22.089
Someone's shooting into the flats
through the window.


00:30:22.200 --> 00:30:25.727
I'll give you five seconds
to start telling the fucking truth,


00:30:25.840 --> 00:30:28.286
otherwise I'll start cutting off this ear.


00:30:28.400 --> 00:30:32.007
- Look, look...
- Stay fucking there, Paul!


00:30:33.600 --> 00:30:35.523
- Five.
- Kurtis, it's true.


00:30:35.640 --> 00:30:38.211
- Honestly, there's someone outside...
- Four.


00:30:38.320 --> 00:30:40.243
- Brian's dead, Amy's dead.
- Three.


00:30:40.360 --> 00:30:43.762
Jenny's kids. Mark's been hun.
Call him! There's no signal!


00:30:43.880 --> 00:30:46.451
- One!
- Open the curtains!


00:30:48.120 --> 00:30:51.681
- No, you fucking open them.
- No, don't, please, he'll shoot me!


00:30:58.280 --> 00:31:00.886
You nearly broke my fucking shoulder,
mate.


00:31:01.000 --> 00:31:03.924
- I was aiming for your head.
- Have you lost the plot?


00:31:04.040 --> 00:31:05.883
Just open the curtains!


00:31:09.160 --> 00:31:11.970
Get back, get back!


00:31:12.080 --> 00:31:13.730
Get back.


00:31:20.880 --> 00:31:23.008
Shit!


00:31:24.560 --> 00:31:27.040
- Where's Mark?
- In the hall.


00:31:57.160 --> 00:32:00.687
Oh, you're still with us, then?
That's a relief.


00:32:07.560 --> 00:32:09.324
Talk to us, lads.


00:32:09.440 --> 00:32:11.966
Someone's outside shooting us, man.
Got me fucking bad.


00:32:12.080 --> 00:32:14.048
I don't know why, man.


00:32:15.160 --> 00:32:17.242
Fucking bollocks.


00:32:21.360 --> 00:32:24.648
What the fucking hell's
this shit, then, eh?


00:32:40.560 --> 00:32:43.928
Oh! Oh, fuck me, father!


00:32:52.560 --> 00:32:55.245
Someone's trying to kill us all.


00:32:55.360 --> 00:32:57.727
We dunno why
and we dunno who it is.


00:32:59.040 --> 00:33:01.930
What about
the developer guy, Rawlins?


00:33:02.040 --> 00:33:04.008
He's been trying
to get rid of us for ages.


00:33:04.120 --> 00:33:07.203
No. No way.
The police are bound to suspect him.


00:33:07.320 --> 00:33:09.766
- What if it is?
- I don't give a fuck who it is.


00:33:09.880 --> 00:33:14.044
- It's probably a random psychopath.
- He's not crazy. He's well organised.


00:33:14.160 --> 00:33:17.482
- He's taken out phones and internet.
- Also, the gun.


00:33:17.600 --> 00:33:19.170
What do you mean?


00:33:19.280 --> 00:33:23.205
It's really accurate, even with
the laser sight. It's military grade.


00:33:23.320 --> 00:33:27.006
- They're hard to get and expensive.
- How expensive?


00:33:27.120 --> 00:33:31.364
Given the accuracy and range, it's
something like the Heckler & Koch PSG1.


00:33:31.480 --> 00:33:34.882
They go for ten grand.
All the top-level sniper rifles do.


00:33:35.000 --> 00:33:38.686
- How do you know all this?
- I play Battlefield 3 online a lot.


00:33:38.800 --> 00:33:40.928
Too bloody much.


00:33:41.040 --> 00:33:44.408
It's training you how to be a killer
is what it's doing.


00:33:44.520 --> 00:33:48.047
Maybe if we all make a run for it
out the main entrance,


00:33:48.160 --> 00:33:49.844
maybe we could make it.


00:33:49.960 --> 00:33:52.486
It's semi-automatic.
He'd get us in seconds.


00:33:52.600 --> 00:33:56.764
Nice one. Innit just fucking lovely to know
that we're all proper fucked?


00:33:56.880 --> 00:33:59.042
- So what do we do?
- We wait.


00:33:59.160 --> 00:34:01.401
Until the police realise what's up.


00:34:01.520 --> 00:34:04.171
Or until he goes away.


00:34:04.280 --> 00:34:07.011
What if he doesn't go away?


00:34:07.120 --> 00:34:11.728
What if he's gonna stay there...
till he's killed all of us?


00:34:39.920 --> 00:34:42.366
I need a fucking doctor!


00:34:42.480 --> 00:34:45.404
Hang in there, OK?
We'll get help soon.


00:34:46.640 --> 00:34:50.087
- We need to do something!
- Oi. Stay calm, OK?


00:34:50.200 --> 00:34:52.487
Mark needs you.
Just stay with him.


00:34:53.480 --> 00:34:55.528
- He needs help.
- I know.


00:34:55.640 --> 00:34:58.689
We're gonna get out of here somehow.
Promise.


00:35:03.400 --> 00:35:05.971
Calm down, mate.


00:35:09.280 --> 00:35:13.205
If we could figure out a way downstairs,
we could get out the back door


00:35:13.320 --> 00:35:17.006
- and he'd never see us.
- That's a good idea. We should all go.


00:35:17.120 --> 00:35:20.567
OK. You do that, then.
I'll be getting rat-arsed in here.


00:35:20.680 --> 00:35:22.250
What? No, you can't!


00:35:22.360 --> 00:35:25.125
- Hey. Hey, hey, hey! All right!
- Dick.


00:35:27.200 --> 00:35:29.680
Kurtis, we're all working together now.


00:35:29.800 --> 00:35:32.531
Nah, yous can do that.
I'll be having a piss-up.


00:35:32.640 --> 00:35:35.120
Hey! We all pay you for protection!


00:35:35.240 --> 00:35:37.242
- Yeah?
- Yeah. So protect us!


00:35:37.360 --> 00:35:40.728
All right, you're not gonna do
anything stupid, are ya?


00:35:43.240 --> 00:35:45.766
OK, yeah, I'll give you that one.


00:35:47.440 --> 00:35:49.807
Fucking hell.


00:35:59.000 --> 00:36:00.889
You're a fucking bitch, you are.


00:36:04.600 --> 00:36:07.365
You're not in control anymore.


00:36:07.480 --> 00:36:10.404
It's not our problem.


00:36:12.240 --> 00:36:16.040
What about the lift?
There's usually a ladder in there.


00:36:16.160 --> 00:36:18.049
- I'll try that.
- Me, too.


00:36:18.160 --> 00:36:21.164
- What are the rest of us supposed to do?
- Sit tight.


00:36:21.280 --> 00:36:23.203
Jeff, Kurtis, you come, too.


00:36:23.320 --> 00:36:25.482
Jeff? He's just lost his wife.


00:36:25.600 --> 00:36:27.807
I don't want Gary and Kurtis
getting any ideas.


00:36:27.920 --> 00:36:30.207
Gary stays here.
Kurtis, come on!


00:36:32.280 --> 00:36:34.328
How's your bollocks?


00:36:38.200 --> 00:36:40.885
- It's not working.
- What's that?


00:36:41.000 --> 00:36:43.367
I dunno. Local kids messing about?


00:36:43.480 --> 00:36:46.563
- Can we get on with it?
- I'll get Dad's toolbox.


00:36:46.680 --> 00:36:49.126
Stay away from the window!


00:36:54.920 --> 00:36:57.890
There's plenty of screwdrivers.
Just one torch.


00:36:58.000 --> 00:37:01.004
- Good thinking, Daniel.
- Get the fuck out of the way!


00:37:03.480 --> 00:37:05.926
Come on!


00:37:06.040 --> 00:37:09.169
- Come on!
- Yeah, just take it easy.


00:37:09.280 --> 00:37:13.649
You take it easy! I wanna get out of here
and find the bastard that did this!


00:37:14.800 --> 00:37:16.802
Give us the torch.


00:37:16.920 --> 00:37:19.685
Stay back, everyone!
Stay back! Stay back!


00:37:23.880 --> 00:37:26.008
What the fuck is going on?


00:37:26.120 --> 00:37:29.010
Jeff's dead. Stay there!
Stay with Mark!


00:37:29.120 --> 00:37:32.647
- Jesus Christ.
- There's someone in there!


00:37:34.760 --> 00:37:38.890
- Kurtis. Oh, fuck, it's high up.
- What are you doing?


00:37:53.040 --> 00:37:56.567
No, there's nobody there.
It looks like some son of trap.


00:38:00.280 --> 00:38:02.521
Shit!


00:38:04.760 --> 00:38:06.364
Kurtis, careful!


00:38:06.480 --> 00:38:09.165
Shit!


00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:13.007
Motherfucker!


00:38:18.160 --> 00:38:20.367
He could've planted them everywhere.


00:38:20.480 --> 00:38:23.370
We'll just have to be
extra careful then, won't we?


00:38:23.480 --> 00:38:25.687
Are we shifting him then or...


00:38:25.800 --> 00:38:27.848
Let's put him with Amy.


00:38:30.680 --> 00:38:34.526
One, two, three. Yeah? OK?


00:38:47.080 --> 00:38:50.527
Hey. Be careful.


00:39:03.120 --> 00:39:06.442
Jesus.


00:39:18.760 --> 00:39:20.569
OK. Good.


00:39:20.680 --> 00:39:22.921
- OK.
- That's it. Go on.


00:39:34.840 --> 00:39:37.047
Bruv.


00:39:37.160 --> 00:39:39.242
Don't leave me, man.


00:40:04.240 --> 00:40:06.049
That's it.


00:40:21.120 --> 00:40:25.364
I don't want you going in there again.
Do you understand? It's not safe!


00:40:25.480 --> 00:40:28.006
Stop talking to me
like I'm stupid.


00:40:28.120 --> 00:40:32.728
- I'll talk to you any way I like!
- Mum, please, stop it!


00:41:18.760 --> 00:41:22.162
OK, those faces
are starting to creep me out now.


00:41:32.040 --> 00:41:34.725
OK, get back. Watch out.


00:41:37.920 --> 00:41:40.571
No! Fuck!


00:41:42.040 --> 00:41:44.964
Locked. Off we pop, then.


00:41:45.080 --> 00:41:47.811
- Er, aren't you forgetting something?
- Eh?


00:41:47.920 --> 00:41:51.641
- What son of criminal are ya?
- Oh, piss off, you!


00:41:57.400 --> 00:42:01.405
Righty tighty, lefty... Ioosey.


00:42:12.520 --> 00:42:15.046
Come on, you fucking thing!


00:42:15.160 --> 00:42:17.561
- Fuck's sake!
- Do you want me to help?


00:42:17.680 --> 00:42:19.682
- Piss off, Paul!
- Right, OK.


00:42:21.160 --> 00:42:23.970
Come on then,
you fucking shit of a thing!


00:42:24.080 --> 00:42:27.163
Paul, you do this. Wait, wait, wait.
Stand back, Kurt.


00:42:32.000 --> 00:42:34.082
One.


00:42:34.200 --> 00:42:35.770
Two.


00:42:37.960 --> 00:42:39.450
Three!


00:42:43.120 --> 00:42:45.043
Bastard!


00:42:48.120 --> 00:42:51.681
Look, if we push at the same time,
we might be able to move it.


00:42:51.800 --> 00:42:53.643
- Yeah?
- Come on. Count of three.


00:42:53.760 --> 00:42:55.000
Come on!


00:42:55.120 --> 00:42:57.407
OK? On three.
One, two, three.


00:42:57.520 --> 00:42:59.010
Fucking hell!


00:43:00.800 --> 00:43:03.690
' Keep Pushing!


00:43:03.800 --> 00:43:05.643
- Nah.
- Keep pushing!


00:43:05.760 --> 00:43:10.288
- Stop. This is impossible!
- Great! Just fucking great!


00:43:11.480 --> 00:43:14.131
Yeah, well worth it, that, wasn't it?


00:43:14.240 --> 00:43:16.322
Probably worth Jeff's life.


00:43:17.520 --> 00:43:19.966
- Stop it.
- Stop what?


00:43:20.080 --> 00:43:22.811
Still, it's one less person to worry about.


00:43:22.920 --> 00:43:24.968
- Fuck you!
- Fuck you, mate.


00:43:26.320 --> 00:43:28.527
I didn't kill him, did I?


00:43:31.000 --> 00:43:33.162
OK. OK.


00:43:33.280 --> 00:43:35.886
Right, OK, so what do we do now?


00:43:38.280 --> 00:43:40.282
We go back upstairs.


00:44:01.000 --> 00:44:04.766
- How's your leg, Mark?
- It's fucking agony, what do you think?


00:44:07.120 --> 00:44:09.248
I'm gonna need some more pills.


00:44:10.960 --> 00:44:14.601
- It ain't been four hours...
- Just give me the pills, man.


00:44:14.720 --> 00:44:16.927
It says it on the label.


00:44:28.800 --> 00:44:31.087
This is weird, isn't it?


00:44:31.200 --> 00:44:34.044
Yeah. Weird.


00:44:35.920 --> 00:44:38.651
And that's the end
of that conversation, yeah?


00:44:39.800 --> 00:44:43.202
So what now?
There must be something we can do.


00:44:43.320 --> 00:44:46.608
Probably is, yeah.
Just let us know when you work it out, eh?


00:44:46.720 --> 00:44:49.326
- What about the roof?
- What about it?


00:44:49.440 --> 00:44:53.126
If someone climbs down the back
of the building, the sniper won't see.


00:44:53.240 --> 00:44:55.971
But how would they climb down,
this someone?


00:44:56.080 --> 00:44:58.924
I don't know.
We could tie together lots of sheets.


00:44:59.040 --> 00:45:02.362
I'm not doing it. Neither is Daniel.
We've suffered enough.


00:45:02.480 --> 00:45:06.610
We've all suffered, all right, Carol?
We'll ask for volunteers.


00:45:06.720 --> 00:45:09.883
Well, you can count me out
and all. Sheets?


00:45:10.000 --> 00:45:13.209
They're never gonna hold
any fucker's weight, are they?


00:45:13.320 --> 00:45:16.210
- We could use the fire hose.
- It's not long enough.


00:45:16.320 --> 00:45:19.563
Tie them together.
They took them out of the other floors.


00:45:19.680 --> 00:45:22.570
- They're down there.
- Great idea! This could work!


00:45:22.680 --> 00:45:27.049
- Look at it. What if it rips?
- I don't think you'll get any volunteers.


00:45:27.160 --> 00:45:31.051
- If it goes wrong, it's a massive drop.
- What other choice do we have?


00:45:31.160 --> 00:45:34.323
This is ridiculous!
We haven't done anything!


00:45:34.440 --> 00:45:37.808
- He's got to leave sometime.
- He's got going anywhere.


00:45:37.920 --> 00:45:42.562
This isn't just some random attack.
All the planning, these pictures.


00:45:42.680 --> 00:45:45.650
He's trying to tell us something
or teach us a lesson.


00:45:45.760 --> 00:45:48.081
What does it mean, then?


00:45:49.880 --> 00:45:53.566
See no evil.
Hear no evil. Speak no evil.


00:45:53.680 --> 00:45:56.968
- The three wise monkeys.
- She's right.


00:45:57.080 --> 00:45:59.606
What does that mean for us?


00:45:59.720 --> 00:46:02.724
It's the boy who was killed here last year.


00:46:02.840 --> 00:46:07.129
Nobody saw nothing,
heard nothing or said nothing.


00:46:08.120 --> 00:46:12.125
We didn't help.
So nobody got arrested for his murder.


00:46:13.240 --> 00:46:15.208
It's our fault.


00:46:17.400 --> 00:46:21.405
God has come down to punish us
cos we let that boy die


00:46:21.520 --> 00:46:23.761
and now it's our turn.


00:46:23.880 --> 00:46:26.850
I tried to help.
I got the shit kicked out of me for it.


00:46:26.960 --> 00:46:31.443
You wouldn't talk to the police.
None of us did. We are all to blame!


00:46:36.200 --> 00:46:38.407
Jenny, what you doing?


00:46:38.520 --> 00:46:42.889
My babies are up in heaven now.
I'm gonna go with them.


00:46:43.000 --> 00:46:45.162
- Jenny, no!
- No, Jenny!


00:46:45.280 --> 00:46:47.328
' Jenny!


00:46:47.440 --> 00:46:49.442
- No! No! No! No!
- No, no, no.


00:46:49.560 --> 00:46:52.006
No!


00:46:53.040 --> 00:46:54.929
Oh, God. Come on.


00:47:28.680 --> 00:47:31.411
God!


00:47:36.960 --> 00:47:40.089
I suppose she couldn't cope
with losing her little ones.


00:47:40.200 --> 00:47:42.885
Oh, don't start talking fucking bollocks.


00:47:44.960 --> 00:47:48.407
She couldn't care less.
She treated them like shit, mate.


00:47:48.520 --> 00:47:52.605
What? I know you're all thinking it.
You fucking hypocrites.


00:47:52.720 --> 00:47:55.530
She desen/ed it.
She did. She desen/ed it.


00:47:55.640 --> 00:47:58.325
For every time
she fucking screamed at them,


00:47:58.440 --> 00:48:00.442
smacked them,
left them on their own!


00:48:00.560 --> 00:48:03.803
You don't do that to kids.
You just don't.


00:48:04.920 --> 00:48:08.208
You do that then you get
what's coming to you, don't you?


00:48:08.320 --> 00:48:10.243
So fuck it off!


00:48:33.040 --> 00:48:35.168
It's dark.


00:48:35.280 --> 00:48:38.090
Can't we just turn off the lights
and sneak out?


00:48:38.200 --> 00:48:41.283
No, he's set all this up,
he'll have night-vision.


00:48:41.400 --> 00:48:44.609
- You don't know that.
- Well, there's one way to find out.


00:48:44.720 --> 00:48:47.690
He'll be expecting it.
He's waiting for us to slip up.


00:48:47.800 --> 00:48:51.407
He's thought of fucking everything.
Every last detail.


00:48:54.880 --> 00:48:57.486
So what about these faces, lads?
There, look.


00:48:57.600 --> 00:48:59.489
- Where?
- These faces, there.


00:48:59.600 --> 00:49:03.446
They're all over the building
and specifically your door. Why?


00:49:03.560 --> 00:49:06.006
- Dunno, they're just...
- Hey!


00:49:06.120 --> 00:49:08.964
Look, man, we don't know anything.


00:49:09.080 --> 00:49:12.163
- I dunno why they're on our door.
- They're just there!


00:49:12.280 --> 00:49:14.760
- Yeah?
- Yeah!


00:49:21.240 --> 00:49:23.766
- In the flat then, lads.
- What?


00:49:23.880 --> 00:49:26.645
- In the flat. I want a word with ya.
- All right.


00:49:26.760 --> 00:49:28.888
What, man? What?


00:49:34.240 --> 00:49:36.242
Ah, fuck!


00:49:40.080 --> 00:49:42.162
Oi, what you doing?


00:49:45.280 --> 00:49:49.604
- Drugs?
- Yeah, drugs. Call the pigs.


00:49:51.120 --> 00:49:53.964
Just be careful.
Make sure you don't open the...


00:49:55.000 --> 00:49:56.764
...cullains.


00:50:18.440 --> 00:50:20.681
Some kid gets kicked in
out there, yeah?


00:50:20.800 --> 00:50:24.691
And you two muppets suddenly disappear?
Am I losing my touch?


00:50:24.800 --> 00:50:27.849
- Kurtis, it's not like that.
- Shut the fuck up.


00:50:27.960 --> 00:50:30.486
I know those last few bunches
come up short.


00:50:30.600 --> 00:50:35.083
Yeah. Selling it on the side, was yous?
Did he get in the middle?


00:50:35.200 --> 00:50:39.091
So you kicked him in in your own fucking
building? Have you lost the plot?


00:50:39.200 --> 00:50:42.170
This is fucking stupid!
Where you getting this from?


00:50:42.280 --> 00:50:44.567
Come on, Kurtis, please!


00:50:44.680 --> 00:50:47.889
- Fucking leave him alone! Come on, man!
- Oi, oi.


00:50:48.000 --> 00:50:50.321
- Fucking hell!
- What you doing?


00:50:50.440 --> 00:50:53.683
- Leave him alone!
- Tell me what the fuck happened now.


00:50:53.800 --> 00:50:57.771
All right! He couldn't pay us
the money that he owed us.


00:50:57.880 --> 00:51:02.363
So fuck it, we were just gonna beat him up,
scare him. We didn't mean to kill him.


00:51:07.000 --> 00:51:09.162
You divvie cunts!


00:51:09.280 --> 00:51:12.045
Do you see what yous have
fucking started, boys?


00:51:12.160 --> 00:51:13.605
Sony, man!


00:51:13.720 --> 00:51:15.802
Oh, my God.


00:51:16.800 --> 00:51:18.529
It was those two!


00:51:19.840 --> 00:51:24.289
They murdered that poor boy
in our own building?


00:51:24.400 --> 00:51:27.802
If it's those two they want,
we should just give them to him.


00:51:27.920 --> 00:51:30.651
- Hold on.
- No, no, we haven't done anything!


00:51:30.760 --> 00:51:33.240
They should give themselves up
to save us!


00:51:33.360 --> 00:51:38.002
Look, Kurtis, think. It can't be that, man.
Why would he wait so long?


00:51:38.120 --> 00:51:40.327
I don't fucking know. Planning.


00:51:40.440 --> 00:51:43.364
Yous are gonna go out there
and have a word with him.


00:51:43.480 --> 00:51:46.245
- Nah, man.
- No way, man! It was an accident!


00:51:46.360 --> 00:51:48.362
- It was a fucking accident!
- Was it?


00:51:48.480 --> 00:51:50.084
I'm not gonna let him shoot us!


00:51:50.200 --> 00:51:52.043
- An accident?
- Yes!


00:51:52.160 --> 00:51:55.084
What you doing?


00:51:55.200 --> 00:51:56.929
- Go on, then, go on.
- No!


00:51:57.040 --> 00:51:59.327
- Try it with me! Go on!
- No!


00:52:01.400 --> 00:52:03.368
What are they doing?


00:52:03.480 --> 00:52:05.642
Kurtis? Kurtis!


00:52:05.760 --> 00:52:07.762
No!


00:52:07.880 --> 00:52:09.769
' No?
' N0! No!


00:52:11.680 --> 00:52:13.284
Kunis!


00:52:13.400 --> 00:52:17.007
- Don't do anything stupid, Kurtis!
- Open up, Kurtis.


00:52:17.120 --> 00:52:18.884
Kunis!


00:52:19.000 --> 00:52:21.002
- Where you off?
- Kurtis!


00:52:21.120 --> 00:52:23.566
Going, are ya?
Go on, then.


00:52:23.680 --> 00:52:26.251
Open the door!
Go on, then.


00:52:26.360 --> 00:52:29.728
Nah! I'll show you Gary. Have a look.


00:52:29.840 --> 00:52:32.571
There he is. See that? Have a look.


00:52:32.680 --> 00:52:35.604
- Be careful!
- Do you like that? Go on, get up.


00:52:35.720 --> 00:52:37.609
Open it! Open the door! Kurtis!


00:52:37.720 --> 00:52:41.202
- Kurtis!
- Come on then, Mark, up you get.


00:52:41.320 --> 00:52:44.005
Up you get. In your own time.


00:52:44.120 --> 00:52:47.363
' Kunis!


00:52:47.480 --> 00:52:51.280
Come on, lively. Come on!


00:52:51.400 --> 00:52:54.449
Go on, first punch, have it.
Go on. Go on!


00:53:09.960 --> 00:53:11.769
Fucking hell.


00:53:22.600 --> 00:53:24.284
Fucking hell.


00:54:09.960 --> 00:54:11.962
What did you do?


00:54:14.840 --> 00:54:17.730
You know what I did.
I did the right thing.


00:54:20.120 --> 00:54:23.522
- You killed them?
- Nah, mate, he killed them.


00:54:23.640 --> 00:54:25.642
Jesus Christ!


00:54:31.360 --> 00:54:34.011
All right, yeah,
I did a very, very bad thing.


00:54:35.560 --> 00:54:37.369
Very bad.


00:54:39.880 --> 00:54:42.087
Doesn't mean I was wrong.


00:54:45.360 --> 00:54:49.649
Anyway, it was me that did it.
So none of yous need to feel guilty.


00:54:50.640 --> 00:54:53.610
I dunno why you give a shit.
They kicked your head in.


00:54:53.720 --> 00:54:55.722
Gary could've climbed off the roof.


00:54:55.840 --> 00:54:59.003
He doesn't need to now.
The sniper's killed them. End of.


00:54:59.120 --> 00:55:02.010
- Have you stood at the window?
- No, Becky, I didn't.


00:55:02.120 --> 00:55:04.202
- So you don't know!
- Of course I don't!


00:55:04.320 --> 00:55:06.561
- He's a fucking nut job!
- How do we test it?


00:55:06.680 --> 00:55:09.923
I don't know, Nev, stick an arm out.
Go on, then!


00:55:10.040 --> 00:55:13.408
This is stupid! We gave him those two.
He's got what he wants.


00:55:13.520 --> 00:55:15.409
- Carol.
- We're leaving.


00:55:15.520 --> 00:55:18.046
- We can't!
- Look, just do as you're told!


00:55:18.160 --> 00:55:21.323
- It'll be fine. He'll leave us alone.
- He might not do!


00:55:21.440 --> 00:55:24.887
- We don't know if he will!
- We haven't done anything!


00:55:25.000 --> 00:55:28.607
- He'll let us go!
- Carol, I know you're upset. We all are.


00:55:28.720 --> 00:55:30.722
Oh, are we?


00:55:30.840 --> 00:55:33.320
You met your bloke,
what, last night?


00:55:33.440 --> 00:55:36.683
I was married to my husband
for 18 years!


00:55:36.800 --> 00:55:39.724
- Excuse me?
- Well, it's hardly the same, is it?


00:55:39.840 --> 00:55:42.650
Losing a husband
and losing a one-night stand.


00:55:43.840 --> 00:55:48.243
How dare you? How dare you decide
who's suffered more here?


00:55:48.360 --> 00:55:50.362
I'll decide whatever I want.


00:55:50.480 --> 00:55:53.689
And right now, I'm deciding
that me and my son are leaving!


00:55:53.800 --> 00:55:55.928
- No, Mum, Mum, Mum!
- Carol!


00:55:56.040 --> 00:55:58.122
- Piss off!
- Don't do this!


00:55:58.240 --> 00:56:00.288
- Are you gonna stop me?
- If I have to!


00:56:00.400 --> 00:56:04.291
- Get out of my fucking way!
- Please! Not Daniel, just in case.


00:56:04.400 --> 00:56:08.166
- Just in case what?
- If you're wrong, you are both dead!


00:56:08.280 --> 00:56:10.408
Please, just think about it.


00:56:17.280 --> 00:56:20.011
Oh, Daniel! I'm sorry.


00:56:26.160 --> 00:56:30.165
Don't be scared, OK?
I'm gonna go and get help.


00:56:30.280 --> 00:56:33.329
You just stay here
and everything will be fine.


00:56:34.440 --> 00:56:37.410
Mum, don't, please.


00:56:37.520 --> 00:56:39.568
I love you.


00:56:40.800 --> 00:56:43.565
I love you too, sweetheart.


00:56:46.560 --> 00:56:48.688
I'll be fine. You'll see.


00:56:48.800 --> 00:56:51.007
And then you can all follow me out.


00:56:54.120 --> 00:56:56.168
- So you're going, then?
- Yep.


00:56:56.280 --> 00:56:59.727
OK, be careful and put your arm out first,
for Christ's sake?


00:56:59.840 --> 00:57:03.606
Why don't we use Mark's arm?
He's not gonna want the fucker, is he?


00:57:03.720 --> 00:57:05.563
It's fine!


00:57:07.720 --> 00:57:09.529
It's fine.


00:57:50.400 --> 00:57:52.482
I think it's OK.


00:57:54.440 --> 00:57:56.761
I'll shout when I get to the bottom, OK?


00:57:57.920 --> 00:58:00.321
Press the intercom on your flat
when you get down,


00:58:00.440 --> 00:58:02.488
so we know you made it safely.


00:58:10.520 --> 00:58:12.170
- Mum, wait!
- No, no, Daniel!


00:58:14.520 --> 00:58:16.443
Fuck!


00:58:24.040 --> 00:58:25.963
You're welcome.


00:58:26.080 --> 00:58:29.129
If they make it down there and
around the corner, we'll know for sure.


00:58:29.240 --> 00:58:30.844
Come on.


00:58:41.960 --> 00:58:44.008
Hurry!


00:59:02.320 --> 00:59:05.085
It's OK. We're down.


00:59:06.080 --> 00:59:09.129
He made it! He made it! Daniel!


00:59:09.240 --> 00:59:11.322
We're gonna get help.


00:59:13.320 --> 00:59:16.085
Shit! Daniel, run!


00:59:16.200 --> 00:59:17.804
Mum!


00:59:26.520 --> 00:59:29.808
Daniel! Daniel!


00:59:29.920 --> 00:59:32.241
Dan...


01:00:17.800 --> 01:00:20.007
Let me go. Let...


01:00:20.120 --> 01:00:22.771
Let me climb down
from the roof, I mean.


01:00:22.880 --> 01:00:25.167
- Why?
- Because I need to do something.


01:00:25.280 --> 01:00:28.284
I'm tired of sitting around
waiting for him to kill us.


01:00:28.400 --> 01:00:30.607
The hoses might not hold.
You could die.


01:00:30.720 --> 01:00:34.520
Yeah, and if they don't,
then we're all dead anyway.


01:00:34.640 --> 01:00:38.087
No. It was my idea.
I should be the one to take the risk.


01:00:38.200 --> 01:00:41.727
No, we need someone with ideas.


01:00:41.840 --> 01:00:44.366
- We need you!
- Me?


01:00:44.480 --> 01:00:47.165
I don't know what I'm doing.


01:00:47.280 --> 01:00:49.567
You're doing pretty well so far.


01:00:49.680 --> 01:00:52.968
Maybe we could...
send a signal from the roof instead.


01:00:53.080 --> 01:00:55.003
Maybe.


01:00:55.120 --> 01:00:57.885
And then he could come in
and finish us off.


01:00:59.080 --> 01:01:01.287
Let me climb down.


01:01:01.400 --> 01:01:04.404
I can't take the responsibility.


01:01:04.520 --> 01:01:07.046
That's why I'm volunteering.


01:01:07.160 --> 01:01:10.050
It's not on your shoulders
if anything goes wrong.


01:01:13.440 --> 01:01:16.603
- We have to try!
- I know.


01:01:18.920 --> 01:01:21.241
Look, if anything happens,


01:01:21.360 --> 01:01:24.967
do you want me to pass a message on
to anyone? Family, friends?


01:01:25.080 --> 01:01:27.731
Nah. I don't have anyone.


01:01:28.720 --> 01:01:31.530
- It's just me.
- I'm sorry.


01:01:32.520 --> 01:01:36.161
Nah, it's OK.
You get used to it.


01:01:36.280 --> 01:01:39.045
Sundays are the worst.


01:01:39.160 --> 01:01:41.686
It's technically Sunday now.


01:01:41.800 --> 01:01:43.802
Oh, yeah.


01:01:44.920 --> 01:01:47.730
Well, it's not the worst Sunday
I've ever had.


01:01:53.040 --> 01:01:55.281
I hope you make it.


01:01:55.400 --> 01:02:00.884
Thanks. Will you remember that
when you're tying them hoses together?


01:02:41.480 --> 01:02:43.767
Jesus, you're shaking!


01:02:45.080 --> 01:02:48.482
- You don't have to do this.
- It's not that. I need a drink.


01:02:48.600 --> 01:02:52.764
- You need to stay sharp.
- No, I mean... I need a drink.


01:02:52.880 --> 01:02:55.724
- What, you're an alcy?
- And you're a drug dealer!


01:02:56.720 --> 01:03:01.408
I... I ran out of booze 24 hours ago.
I'm not coping well.


01:03:01.520 --> 01:03:04.205
- Has anyone got anything?
- I've got some rosé.


01:03:04.320 --> 01:03:06.687
No, no, no!
Fuck that. Hold on.


01:03:06.800 --> 01:03:09.121
Potentially his last drink.
Do you know what I mean?


01:03:09.240 --> 01:03:12.244
So you're gonna want something decent.
Yeah?


01:03:12.360 --> 01:03:14.966
Fucking rosé! Honestly!


01:03:15.080 --> 01:03:18.084
I give up! Two ticks, yeah?


01:03:19.440 --> 01:03:22.523
I... I have been trying to give up.


01:03:22.640 --> 01:03:24.927
You must all think I'm pathetic.


01:03:25.040 --> 01:03:28.044
We've all got our flaws.
That's what keeps us human.


01:03:28.160 --> 01:03:31.448
Nobody here thinks badly of you,
Paul, I promise you that.


01:03:31.560 --> 01:03:33.881
Whisky!


01:03:38.560 --> 01:03:42.406
Single barrel shit, mate.
Only for special occasions, yeah?


01:03:44.120 --> 01:03:46.088
There y'are, lad.


01:03:48.080 --> 01:03:50.845
OK, yeah, more for you? Cheers.


01:03:58.400 --> 01:04:00.528
Are you feeling better?


01:04:03.640 --> 01:04:06.291
Much better. Thank you.


01:04:06.400 --> 01:04:10.325
Nah, don't thank me, mate.
Just get the next round, yeah?


01:04:11.800 --> 01:04:15.771
OK, let's do this.
Vi, you're staying here.


01:04:15.880 --> 01:04:17.928
Nev, wait!


01:04:18.040 --> 01:04:21.362
Sweetheart,
it's gonna be dangerous up there.


01:04:21.480 --> 01:04:24.882
I'm not bloody useless.
I'm not staying here by myself.


01:04:25.000 --> 01:04:27.651
Either we both go or we both stay.
That's final!


01:04:29.000 --> 01:04:31.810
You're not too old
to put across my knee, you know?


01:04:31.920 --> 01:04:33.809
Promises, promises.


01:04:33.920 --> 01:04:35.684
Fucking hell!


01:04:37.480 --> 01:04:40.962
Ugh! Fuck about! Right, then.


01:04:41.080 --> 01:04:43.162
Let's have a look.


01:04:43.280 --> 01:04:46.966
Let's... fucking... have it.


01:04:48.080 --> 01:04:50.890
- Aw, yeah! Ya fucking beauty.
- Wait, Violet!


01:04:52.040 --> 01:04:55.283
<i>_ 7 Vi!</i>


01:04:56.600 --> 01:04:59.683
No, no, no!
No, no, no, no! Vi!


01:05:02.000 --> 01:05:04.207
I love you, Nev.


01:05:04.320 --> 01:05:07.324
I love you too, baby! Ohh!


01:05:07.440 --> 01:05:10.046
Oh, God, Vi!


01:05:10.160 --> 01:05:11.924
Vi!


01:05:12.040 --> 01:05:14.964
No!


01:05:19.760 --> 01:05:22.331
Nev.


01:05:22.440 --> 01:05:25.728
Nev, stay here, OK?
Look at me. Look at me.


01:05:25.840 --> 01:05:29.731
Nev, we are gonna get out of this!
I promise you, we are gonna make it.


01:05:59.400 --> 01:06:01.482
Whenever you're ready.


01:06:07.160 --> 01:06:09.162
Look, if...


01:06:09.280 --> 01:06:13.285
If anything happens and...
and you still get out of here...


01:06:16.040 --> 01:06:19.681
- ...will you tell them I tried?
- Don't think like that!


01:06:59.080 --> 01:07:00.844
Go on!


01:07:03.320 --> 01:07:05.926
Paul?
Yeah.


01:07:15.440 --> 01:07:17.488
So far, so good!


01:07:17.600 --> 01:07:20.171
- It's working!
- Go on, then, Paul, son!


01:07:32.120 --> 01:07:34.327
No. No! We'll get you back up!


01:07:34.440 --> 01:07:37.330
Paul, you're gonna have to get down!
Pretty quick!


01:07:42.280 --> 01:07:44.681
No! We've gotta distract him!


01:07:44.800 --> 01:07:47.804
Fuck it, then! Come on then, son!


01:07:47.920 --> 01:07:49.888
Let's fucking have it, then!


01:07:50.000 --> 01:07:53.209
- No!
- Shoot at me then, cunt! Come on!


01:07:53.320 --> 01:07:55.448
- Paul!
- I'm stood here!


01:08:07.560 --> 01:08:09.881
- No, no!
- Whoa, Becky! Fucking hell!


01:08:10.000 --> 01:08:12.321
Get down! Fuck me!


01:08:12.440 --> 01:08:14.886
He's gone now, Becks.


01:08:16.040 --> 01:08:18.247
OK.


01:08:18.360 --> 01:08:21.204
He's just gonna fucking
toy with us now, mate.


01:08:29.200 --> 01:08:31.646
You bastard!


01:08:32.640 --> 01:08:34.563
You're not having us all!


01:08:34.680 --> 01:08:37.923
- You're not fucking having us all!
- Fucking right, man!


01:08:43.400 --> 01:08:46.131
We're gonna burn
this fucking place down.


01:09:07.120 --> 01:09:10.408
When you say "burn the place down"
yeah, we're still in it.


01:09:10.520 --> 01:09:15.082
- I hope someone sees it fucking quick.
- What if we burn before anyone turns up?


01:09:15.200 --> 01:09:18.010
We don't give him
the satisfaction of shooting us!


01:09:18.120 --> 01:09:22.523
Not very clever. "You can't shoot me,
I'm on fire! Who's laughing now?"


01:09:22.640 --> 01:09:24.483
- It's a wank plan!
- It'll work!


01:09:24.600 --> 01:09:27.171
- How do you know that?
- Because it has to!


01:09:40.720 --> 01:09:45.089
All right, OK, if we're gonna burn
to death, I'm gonna put some food on.


01:09:46.160 --> 01:09:49.004
Because I'm fucking stan/ing. Yeah?


01:11:27.000 --> 01:11:31.085
OK, Neville, you go down first, OK?
Then you don't have to rush.


01:11:32.880 --> 01:11:35.281
And what about Violet?


01:11:35.400 --> 01:11:39.007
- We can't help her now.
- I'm not leaving her here to burn!


01:11:39.120 --> 01:11:43.284
Nev, someone will come and rescue us
before the fire spreads too far, OK?


01:11:43.400 --> 01:11:46.051
- Then I stay here with her.
- No, please, Nev!


01:11:46.160 --> 01:11:50.290
What if something goes wrong?
Wouldn't she want you to get out safely?


01:11:50.400 --> 01:11:52.687
What would she say to you?


01:11:54.560 --> 01:11:57.609
She'd tell me not to be
such a stubborn bastard.


01:11:57.720 --> 01:12:00.690
- There you go, then.
- You going with him then, yeah?


01:12:00.800 --> 01:12:02.928
- Mm-hm.
- I'll set it off up here.


01:12:03.040 --> 01:12:05.486
You know you'd only cock it up.


01:12:05.600 --> 01:12:10.288
And I don't want yous in my way
when I slide down the lift full pelt, all right?


01:12:10.400 --> 01:12:12.528
- Good.
- Touching.


01:12:13.800 --> 01:12:16.531
Well, piss off, then.
I'm stood here waiting.


01:13:03.760 --> 01:13:05.967
- OK?
- Yeah.


01:13:07.080 --> 01:13:09.082
OK.


01:13:10.080 --> 01:13:11.969
You all right?


01:13:12.080 --> 01:13:15.004
We're down!


01:14:58.960 --> 01:15:01.201
Oh, fuck!


01:15:01.320 --> 01:15:04.130
Oh, no, no!


01:15:05.320 --> 01:15:07.721
Oh, fucking hell!


01:15:09.000 --> 01:15:11.970
- Help!
- Kurtis!


01:15:12.080 --> 01:15:15.448
- We're here! We're here!
- It's fucking bad!


01:15:16.520 --> 01:15:18.841
I've snapped my leg!


01:15:18.960 --> 01:15:21.566
Oh, fuck!


01:15:21.680 --> 01:15:23.887
- All right.
- Gotcha.


01:15:24.000 --> 01:15:26.970
Whoa, whoa, whoa, steady!
Wait, wait, wait, wait!


01:15:27.080 --> 01:15:29.606
- Come on! Come on!
- Put him over there.


01:15:29.720 --> 01:15:33.042
Oh, fucking hell, it's bad, innit?
It's fucking bad!


01:15:33.160 --> 01:15:36.687
It's all right, Kurt.


01:15:36.800 --> 01:15:38.768
Help's on its way, OK?


01:15:38.880 --> 01:15:41.611
Fucking hell! Oh, fuck!


01:15:42.640 --> 01:15:45.166
Fuck!


01:15:45.280 --> 01:15:47.123
Fucking hell!


01:15:48.600 --> 01:15:52.400
- Easy! Easy! Easy!
- OK! OK! I've gotta tie this.


01:15:52.520 --> 01:15:55.922
Oh, fucking hell! Oh, shit!


01:15:56.040 --> 01:15:59.442
- Agh! Agh! Whoa, whoa!
- All right, all right, all right!


01:16:12.880 --> 01:16:16.123
Hang in there.


01:16:17.120 --> 01:16:21.125
- How long now?
- We wait... till the police get here.


01:16:35.680 --> 01:16:37.682
Here you go!


01:16:44.040 --> 01:16:47.408
Hello?
What the hell is going on?


01:16:47.520 --> 01:16:49.887
- What's going on?
- Kev.


01:16:50.000 --> 01:16:51.889
What?


01:16:53.200 --> 01:16:56.682
- Christ almighty!
- Call someone, quick!


01:16:56.800 --> 01:16:59.804
Well, I can't,
my phone's gone to shit! Hello?


01:17:00.880 --> 01:17:04.248
Bloody hell!
I hope there's no-one in there.


01:17:04.360 --> 01:17:06.488
What the fuck is that?


01:17:07.480 --> 01:17:08.766
Fuck!


01:17:12.400 --> 01:17:14.164
What...


01:17:14.280 --> 01:17:16.681
Fuck! Fuck!


01:17:16.800 --> 01:17:19.406
Oh, no, shit,
he's shooting them!


01:17:19.520 --> 01:17:22.603
- Fucking hell!
- They can't help us now.


01:17:24.680 --> 01:17:27.604
Get back here, you bastard!


01:17:32.800 --> 01:17:35.041
Help! Help me!


01:17:35.160 --> 01:17:37.970
Wait.


01:17:38.080 --> 01:17:40.447
Oh, my God.
Oh! Help me, please!


01:17:40.560 --> 01:17:43.131
- Someone's made it!
- Shush!


01:17:43.240 --> 01:17:45.049
No. No! No!


01:17:45.160 --> 01:17:47.242
Get him up!


01:17:49.920 --> 01:17:52.685
Go down the end.


01:17:52.800 --> 01:17:57.408
Break into one of the flats.
I'll sneak out and get help. Go! Go on, go!


01:20:39.600 --> 01:20:41.443
Fuck!


01:20:44.560 --> 01:20:47.325
Go on, Nev, fucking have him!


01:21:06.560 --> 01:21:10.804
Oh, fuck me! It's that pig!
Remember? He come knocking that time!


01:21:10.920 --> 01:21:14.686
Why? We never did anything to you.


01:21:14.800 --> 01:21:17.963
You fucking psycho!


01:21:19.520 --> 01:21:22.569
You murdered a load of innocent people.
For nothing!


01:21:22.680 --> 01:21:24.603
Innocent?


01:21:24.720 --> 01:21:26.927
Those fucking scumbags murdered him.


01:21:27.040 --> 01:21:29.008
You should've helped him!


01:21:29.120 --> 01:21:31.600
None of you would talk
so the killers got away with it!


